{"caseId":"recovered-19ca8174722a03a2afbf8f5f00418ae33aa5ff6c500ddf09f87be8c0e9e94065","inputHash":"1edf4384f6c4e975601c1bcd79db203bd0acbe2b6e6b95bd489931a223b217ed","notificationWarranted":true,"rationale":"New 851-line JobLifecycleService mixes genuinely independent change reasons in one class: DB-backed job/sandbox lifecycle (create/close/delete/archive), GitHub PR polling and state application (pollPrClosures, applyGithubPrState, closeJobPullRequest), repo onboarding bookkeeping (markRepoOnboarded, tryRevalidateAccess), host filesystem dir cleanup, and liveness probing. The pollPrClosures/applyGithubPrState PR-sync block changes with GitHub API and wake-funnel requirements, not with sandbox provisioning. God-class creation.","reviewer":"blind-agent-v3","reviewerModel":"unknown","reviewedAt":"2026-10-07T19:10:09.991410+00:00"}
{"caseId":"recovered-8e53d3f3dd69476b33d7064e99cd982ebff37bb5d6b050b312b80e008966e3f3","inputHash":"4aa95e742a64cde4d35c8b6c07543d85fd8ce8af377cab675cad369dd802375d","notificationWarranted":true,"rationale":"StimulusStoreService is primarily a cohesive inbound-stimulus persistence service (record/lease/deliver/chat+event rows), but it also owns findOwningJobByBranch/findOwningJobByPrNumber — job-ownership resolution queries over JobEntity that change with job-routing rules, not with the stimulus store schema. Modest but real mixed responsibility introduced at creation.","reviewer":"blind-agent-v3","reviewerModel":"unknown","reviewedAt":"2026-10-07T19:10:09.991410+00:00"}
