{"caseId":"recovered-6fbc6d5dca36802e2148a54d5a6d85973bcf56bed7c2aff4542ccfe7d2f00440","inputHash":"67f934f1b954fedc4f6304934f1dad8655cc911863feb07dee5db09511fe8a38","notificationWarranted":false,"rationale":"LocalGitService is a cohesive low-level git adapter: every method shells out to git or manages locks around git operations. Security scanning (scanBranchForForbidden) is still a git-content query. One reason to change: how Atlas talks to git. Creation of a cohesive subject is not an introduced mix.","reviewer":"blind-agent-v3","reviewerModel":"unknown","reviewedAt":"2026-10-07T19:10:09.991410+00:00"}
